  "2026-10-29T02:44:12.564Z",codex-agent,"Rebuilt shipped-artifact validation passed: node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/critical.acceptance.ts, 1/1 root, native Node and Bun from one archive, four same-author OS peers, two rollback cancellations preserving Task references, and four compact JSON/TOON CLI refusals before durable writes. Final integrity: sha512-lYlnMdrtq9Pt/AKNXyYGF1fEWfjmJl6RoSrDBSG5ScBzJrfcDamJLCkeLn1diu0CxhgkrqzpXgxatjoIDTJcYQ==. Read-only public-copy validation reran successfully against public commit fc05dfd0495e15946ca31b6c93250eaf704689c3: 17 items, six bodies, 232693 SDK input bytes; each harness retained 17 guidance records, 34 renewals, 19 files and 17 unchanged retries, with edited guidance needs-renewal. Source fingerprint stayed 652fd875763b57b52c1fb7af1a98e8d655511188a9129f5b8c7fa56a73c22fb7. Final test-helper extraction retained every assertion and its four controls passed. Typecheck, lint, build, 42-file/155-declaration documentation and zero duplication across 112 sources pass. No ignored build output or binary artifact is staged."
  "2026-10-29T02:44:17.294Z",codex-agent,"Model evidence remains bounded honestly: the 500-sequence stateful contract and 500-per-law suites are unchanged. One focused batch, sequences 50-54 under master 0x1363cafe, passed 230 SDK read-back comparisons with seeds 4198076704, 2557545177, 917013650, 3571449419, 1930917892. The final repeat completed 50/51 before the unchanged 600-second parent timeout; sequence 52 then saw fixture cleanup during an in-flight read and did not complete. That repeat is not a passing batch or a product-state counterexample. The full current-head models and unchanged 100/100/100/100 coverage remain CI evidence. SDK follow-up pm-memory-sdk-transaction-reader is enriched with native expectedItemHash and transaction-only coordination limitations (upstream 1576/1620), remains open and has no claim. All current import, CLI, JSON/TOON, companion, non-git and packed-consumer paths share cancellation/field ownership. Final-head CI URLs and counts will be reported in PR 15 and its stable checks page https://github.com/unbraind/pm-memory/pull/15/checks ; latest instructions cap this round at 45 minutes of CI observation. Release this agent claim without closing the feature."
